  "worked_solution": "Using the distributive law, we multiply each term inside the parentheses by the number $3:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3(5u-v) & = \\\\ 3\\cdot 5u+3\\cdot (-v) & = \\\\ (15u)+(-3v) & = \\\\ 15u-3v\\end{aligned}\n$$",
